  "body": "Perfectly positioned at the end of this boutique development, this home enjoys a private and peaceful setting, with more land and multiple parking spaces - a rare advantage in today's new-build market.\r\n\r\nThe asking price is very reasonable - make your offer today!\r\n\r\nDesigned by an award-winning architect, this light-filled two-level residence offers four generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite and pleasant sea views.\r\n\r\nStep outside and embrace one of the North Shore's most sought-after coastal lifestyles. Enjoy morning walks through Centennial Park, a round at Pupuke Golf Club, a game at Campbells Bay Tennis Club, or an easy stroll to Campbells Bay Beach, local cafes and restaurants.\r\n\r\nWhether you're raising a family or seeking a low-maintenance coastal lifestyle, this home delivers an enviable combination of space, privacy and convenience.\r\n\r\nZoned for the highly regarded Campbells Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School, this is an address that will appeal to families for years to come.\r\n\r\nOnly three homes remain in this boutique development. Don't miss your opportunity to make this one yours.",
